===Etymology===
Attested 1643.<ref>{{R:Phrase Finder|24300|Adam’s ale}}</ref> Reference to the only drink available to [[Adam]], the first man in the biblical tradition, while in [[Eden]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Adam]][['s]] [[ale]]|-}}

# {{context|archaic|humorous|lang=en}} [[water|Water]].
